OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm a double world champ but
OL,4,Acan't quit my job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA world sidecar racing champion who has
OL,7,Fjust secured his second gold medal says
OL,8,Fhe cannot give up his day job as a
OL,9,Fmechanic as there is no money in
OL,10,Fwinning.
OL,12,FAt the weekend, Harrison Payne, 34, and
OL,13,Fhis French passenger Kevin Rousseau,
OL,14,F33, clinched their second FIM Sidecar
OL,15,FWorld Championship.
OL,17,FPayne, from Wivenhoe in Essex, has been
OL,18,Ffighting to get the sport some exposure
OL,19,Fsince the pair's previous championship
OL,20,Fwin in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
