OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm a double world champ but
OL,4,Acan't quit my job'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've got another medal now, and yeah,
OL,7,Fthat's about it really. You don't get
OL,8,Fmoney or something like that, it's not
OL,9,Freally a job. My normal job is I'm just
OL,10,Fa mechanic, so I was back to work
OL,11,Fstraight away when I got home," he
OL,12,Fsaid.
